{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14002","headline":"下邽客舍喜叔孙主簿郑少府见过 · 耿湋","name":"下邽客舍喜叔孙主簿郑少府见过","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良宵复杪秋，把酒说羇游。\n落木东西别，寒萍远近流。\n萧条旅馆月，寂历曙更筹。\n不是仇梅至，何人问百忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}